{"t":"CVX","made":"2026-11-14 00:19","name":"Chevron Corporation","ko":"셰브론","sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas Integrated","employees":43039,"hq":"Houston, TX, United States","website":"https://www.chevron.com","summary_en":"Chevron Corporation, through its subsidiaries, engages in the integrated energy and chemicals operations. It operates through Upstream and Downstream segments. The Upstream segment engages in the exploration for, development, production, and transportation of crude oil and natural gas; processing, liquefaction, transportation, and regasification of liquefied natural gas; transportation of crude oil through pipelines; transportation, storage, and marketing of natural gas; carbon capture and storage; and operation of a gas-to-liquids plant. The Downstream segment refines crude oil into petroleum products; markets crude oil, refined products, and lubricants; manufactures and markets renewable fuels; transports crude oil and refined products through pipeline, marine vessel, motor equipment, and rail car; and manufactures and markets commodity petrochemicals, plastics for industrial uses, and fuel and lubricant additives. The company operates in North America, South America, Europe, Africa, Asia, and Australia. The company was formerly known as ChevronTexaco Corporation and changed its name to Chevron Corporation in May 2005. Chevron Corporation was founded in 1879 and is headquartered in Houston, Texas.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Chevron Corporation은 자회사를 통해 통합 에너지 및 화학 사업에 종사하고 있습니다. 업스트림 및 다운스트림 세그먼트를 통해 작동합니다. 업스트림 부문은 원유 및 천연가스의 탐사, 개발, 생산 및 운송에 종사합니다. 액화천연가스의 처리, 액화, 운송 및 재기화; 파이프라인을 통한 원유 운송; 천연가스의 운송, 저장 및 마케팅; 탄소 포집 및 저장; 가스-액체 플랜트 운영. 다운스트림 부문은 원유를 석유 제품으로 정제합니다. 원유, 정제 제품 및 윤활유 시장; 재생 가능한 연료를 제조 및 판매합니다. 파이프라인, 해양 선박, 모터 장비 및 철도 차량을 통해 원유 및 정제 제품을 운송합니다. 석유화학제품, 산업용 플라스틱, 연료 및 윤활유 첨가제를 제조 및 판매하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 북미, 남미, 유럽, 아프리카, 아시아 및 호주에서 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 이전에 ChevronTexaco Corporation으로 알려졌으나 2005년 5월에 이름을 Chevron Corporation으로 변경했습니다. Chevron Corporation은 1879년에 설립되었으며 텍사스 주 휴스턴에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":217.79,"mcap":424963506176.0,"pe":15.990455,"fpe":13.203051,"peg":0.8035,"ps":1.8782337,"pb":2.186844,"ev_ebitda":7.721,"div":3.29,"beta":0.453,"hi52":236.48,"lo52":146.49},"fin":{"rev":226256994304.0,"rev_g":0.348,"eps_g":1.78,"gross":0.44384998,"op":0.15105,"net":0.11923,"roe":0.13853,"fcf":26048374784.0,"cash":12803999744.0,"debt":33533999104.0,"de":16.769,"eps":13.62,"feps":16.49543},"own":{"short":0.0135,"inst":0.72155,"insider":0.04818},"analyst":{"n":24,"mean":242.45833,"median":242.5,"high":272.0,"low":202.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.61538,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":6,"buy":15,"hold":5,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":6,"buy":15,"hold":4,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":6,"buy":14,"hold":4,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":6,"buy":14,"hold":4,"sell":1,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-12","Firm":"Bernstein","ToGrade":"Market Perform","FromGrade":"Market Perform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":233.0,"priorPriceTarget":248.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"Freedom Broker","ToGrade":"Hold","FromGrade":"Sell","Action":"up","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":218.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":265.0,"priorPriceTarget":235.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":244.0,"priorPriceTarget":208.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":230.0,"priorPriceTarget":226.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Evercore ISI Group","ToGrade":"Outper